{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>最新一番賞《反斗奇兵》以「配角英雄」為主題登場，陣容多達13種精緻迷你模型！A賞及 Last One 賞重現胡迪勸解自暴自棄巴斯光年的隱藏名場面，胡迪額頭上記號與巴斯背上的火箭花火完美還原！</p><p>B至G賞中有改造玩具如 Babyface、Legs 等；H賞為參加茶會的Nesbitt 太太（巴斯）；I 至 N 賞則集結 RC遙控車、雙筒望遠鏡Lenny、企鵝、索克天王、書蟲等經典角色！這系列將於9月30日於一番賞 ONLINE 限量發售！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179043843904253364_2152988126ab7ec27467e7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179043844066690889_8321436906ab7ec2928f88.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179043844305665192_10863588976ab7ec2b58e24.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179043844460719269_17782289726ab7ec2cceded.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1790438446262984_13263240226ab7ec2e7bb1d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179043844832961461_17576807786ab7ec30ac56a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T16:18:14.900367+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":289,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}